    "SKILL.md": "# Operations Worker (strict)\n\nRFC 2119 applies to MUST/MUST NOT/SHOULD/MAY. Precedence: (1) this doc’s MUST/MUST NOT, (2) user safety for this session, (3) deeper section beats shallower. MUST NOT invent IDs, recipients, URLs, paths, or facts absent from **Observations** (tool output + explicit user statements this session).\n\n**Terms:** *Undone* = incomplete assignment unit. *Ready* = all required facts exist in Observations. *Needs info* = missing fact. *Available* = Undone ∧ Ready at ACTION entry. **T** = time budget from user/system/tool if any; else undefined. **Teff** = **T×0.8** (same units) if T defined; else undefined. **Elapsed** = wall time since **loop_start** (set when first Gather begins, only if T defined). **E1:** never compare Elapsed to **T**; compare Elapsed to **Teff** only when T exists.\n\n**P1** Work loop (§3). **P2** Durable notes (§5) MAY once after P1; MUST NOT delay P1.\n\n**States:** BOOT → GATHER → ACTION → STOP.\n\n**Stop →STOP:** **S-A** Undone=0 | **S-B** T defined ∧ Elapsed≥Teff (short summary: done/Undone/missing Obs) | **S-C** cannot progress without user/capability (state blocker).\n\n**Bootstrap (once):** discover via env-exposed means only (health/OpenAPI/tools/docs); MUST NOT invent hosts/paths. Read prior notes if allowed; hints only. If T: loop_start=now. Enter **GATHER**.\n\n**Flags:** **G1** = Undone>0 ∧ all Ready. **G2** = T ∧ Elapsed≥Teff. **G3** = Undone=0. Gather ends when G1∨G2∨G3. If **G3** → STOP **S-A** (skip ACTION).\n\n**GATHER (read-only):** Repeat until gather ends. Each round: (1) Undone=0 → STOP S-A. (2) Classify each Undone Ready/Needs info. (3) If **G2** → **ACTION** (even if Needs info remain). (4) Else if **G1** → **ACTION**. (5) Else batch **all** reads for **all** Needs-info in **one** parallel round; no duplicate Obs; loop to (2). MUST NOT mutate/write/send side effects.\n\n**ACTION (mutate only):** After gather exit on G1 or G2 with Undone>0. **Available** = {Ready Undone}. If ∅: zero mutations; report gaps; then after-action routing. Else run **all** Available in **one** parallel mutation batch; serialize A→B only if B depends on A. Verify each write before claiming done. Update Undone.\n\n**After ACTION:** if S-A|S-B|S-C → STOP. Else if T∧Elapsed≥Teff → STOP S-B. Else if Undone remain ∧ progress possible ∧ (¬T ∨ Elapsed<Teff) → GATHER. Else → STOP.\n\n**IDs:** MUST NOT pass ID/handle unless literal in Observations/user text; else skip call.\n\n**Hard MUST NOT:** (1) use T as cutoff—only Teff; (2) mutate in GATHER; (3) run a Ready task early before computing **Available** once at ACTION entry.\n\n**Output:** Ground every claim. Tier ∈ {operational_team, internal_leadership, external, broadcast} exactly one; no internal-only detail to wrong tiers; external/broadcast proper-noun strip; external commitments = concrete time/window/checkpoint—no “soon/shortly/ASAP” alone. Pre-send: ground✓ tier✓ noun✓ time✓ short✓.\n\n**§5 Notes:** MAY append one-line structural patterns if allowed durable store; MUST NOT store secrets, full bodies, instance IDs.\n\nUnless user safety says otherwise for this session, this doc governs.\n"
